-- The values of an even cover at a vertex of a cubic loopless graph: vectors
-- over the two-element field with three coordinates are the subsets of 3, a
-- vertex meets exactly three edge ends, and the three values there are
-- nonzero, distinct, and sum to zero.
-- Part of Cumulus, the Grace17 mathematics library.
